2.2.3 - 2026-11-21

[b]简体中文[/b]
[list]
[*]食品加工器新增简易医疗包、高级医疗包和管制医疗包。从对应原料池放入至少三种不同物品即可封装，同种物品的额外件也可一起装入。
[*]直接刷出的三种医疗包和奥克莫吸护理包各含三种默认物品。双击可拆出包内物品。加工制作的包仍保留投入的原件及其状态。
[/list]

[b]English[/b]
[list]
[*]The Food Processor can make Basic, Advanced and Restricted Medical Kits. Add at least three different eligible items to pack a kit. Additional copies of eligible items can go in the same kit.
[*]Spawned medical kits and Nomore Care Kits each contain three default items. Double-click to unpack them. Crafted kits retain the original items and their condition.
[/list]

2.2.2 - 2026-11-16

[b]简体中文[/b]
[list]
[*]奥克莫吸护理包固定用双击拆包，兼容游戏的单击交互设置。
[*]重绘芝士拌面、肉酱拌面、鱼松拌面和奥克莫吸护理包的图标。果味鱼肉冷餐和夜班果冻沿用原设计，改为正向图。
[*]咖啡啤酒和码头气泡啤各占 1×2 格，莓果泉水汽泡占 1×3 格。旧存档载入时也使用新占格。
[/list]

[b]English[/b]
[list]
[*]Double-click the Nomore Care Kit to unpack it regardless of the single-click interaction setting.
[*]Redrew the Cheese Noodles, Meat Sauce Noodles, Fish Floss Noodles and Nomore Care Kit icons. Fruit-Dressed Fish Salad and Night Shift Jelly keep their original designs and now face straight on.
[*]Coffee Beer and Dockside Shandy now occupy 1×2 inventory cells. Berry Spring Fizz occupies 1×3. These sizes also apply to items loaded from older saves.
[/list]

2.2.1 - 2026-11-15

[b]简体中文[/b]
[list]
[*]加工手册、配方选择、原料与产物提示会读取当前语言的翻译，包括语言扩展 Mod 提供的语言。缺少的词条会逐条回退到英语。
