[*]The processing handbook, recipe picker, and ingredient and output labels use translations for the active language, including languages added by other mods. Missing entries fall back to English.
[/list]

2.2.0 - 2026-11-13

[b]简体中文[/b]
[list]
[*]从 49 条扩充到 64 条配方。新增三条一星配方，可制作原版汽水、能量饮料和“泥炭”合成肉。另有 12 种新产物，每种都有独立图标。
[*]小营养果可烘成果干，小鱼片可做浓汤，大鱼片和大营养果可做双人餐。新增荧光莓果酱、菌菇白酱肉排、咖啡因夜班果冻和消毒棉包。
[*]使用奥克莫吸护理包可拆回原注射器、基础绷带和医用酒精，注射器保留原纯度。主库存放不下时，物品留在包内。
[*]把金属锭拖到食品加工器或液体灌装器上，材料区和出货区各加一行。每台机器最多扩容四次，等级随机器保存。
[*]一至三星的机器质量门槛现为 0、50、100。旧配方配置读取时会补齐新配方并保留已有的自定义数量。
[/list]

[b]English[/b]
[list]
[*]Expanded from 49 to 64 recipes. Three new one-star recipes make base-game Soda, Energy Drink and Peat. The other 12 produce new items with individual sprites.
[*]Dry small Nutrifruit, turn small fillets into chowder or make a meal for two with a large fillet and large Nutrifruit. Also added BloomBerry Jam, Steak with Creamy Meal Caps, Night Shift Jelly made with caffeine pills, and Antiseptic Cotton Packs.
[*]Unpack a Nomore Care Kit to recover its original injector, basic bandage and rubbing alcohol. The injector keeps its original purity. The kit stays packed if the main inventory has insufficient room.
[*]Drop a Metal Ingot onto either machine to add one row to both the input and output grids. Each machine can be expanded four times, and its upgrade level is saved.
[*]Machine quality requirements for one-, two- and three-star recipes are now 0, 50 and 100. Existing recipe configurations gain the new recipes on load and retain custom quantities.
[/list]

2.0.0 - 2026-11-12

[b]简体中文[/b]
[list]
[*]扩充到 49 条配方、40 种自定义食品饮料。新增多种面食、罐头、零食、咖啡和汽水，重做啤酒炖肉与食品图标；配方覆盖原版奶酪、鱼饲料和医疗用品。
[*]新增三星配方体系：机器质量达到 0／100／200 解锁对应星级，固定加工加价为 25%／50%／100%。自动模式按配方优先级加工；指定配方缺料时暂停。
[*]重做加工手册与机器配方窗口。图标显示库存能否凑齐原料，手册可按星级筛选和关键词搜索；选定配方后可从可用库存一键补入一批所需的原料和水。
[*]输出框可预览过夜加工的产物与总量；自动模式下可逐批切换查看，并检查实际投料、热量、用水和耗电。
[*]加工品按实际原料分配营养和价值；牲畜血清、工业鱼饲料的加工价值随剩余用途或热量递减。兼容原版冰镇和冷冻。
[*]保留既有物品、配方和机器存档。旧版配方配置读取时补齐新配方，并保留仍适用的自定义数量，不覆盖原文件。
[/list]

[b]English[/b]
[list]
[*]Expanded to 49 recipes and 40 custom foods and drinks. Added noodles, canned meals, snacks, coffees and sodas, updated Beer Stew and food icons, and kept recipes for native cheese, fish feed and medical supplies.
[*]Added three recipe tiers. Machine quality of 0/100/200 unlocks the corresponding tier, with fixed markups of 25%/50%/100%. Automatic mode follows recipe priority; a selected recipe waits for its own ingredients.
[*]Rebuilt the guide and recipe picker around item icons that show whether stock can cover the ingredients. Search or filter the guide by stars. Select a recipe to fill one batch's missing ingredients and water from available stock.
[*]Preview overnight output and total quantities. In automatic mode, browse individual batches and check their inputs, calories, water and power.
[*]Processed goods share nutrition and value from actual ingredients. The added value of livestock serums and industrial fish feed scales with remaining uses or calories. Compatible goods use native chilling and freezing.
[*]Kept existing item and recipe identities and machine saves. Older recipe configs gain the new recipes on read, keep applicable custom quantities and are left intact on disk.
[/list]

