1.0.3 - 2026-11-07

[b]简体中文[/b]
允许不同物种肉料混合加工，不再检查原料的额外化学成分；污染、染朊、腐败及配方专用条件继续生效。混合批次按实际原料保留营养，不标记为某一种物种。
配方查询在原料前提示“污染、染朊或腐败的原料无法加工”，机器配方页、手册和机器提示同步更新。

[b]English[/b]
Allowed meat from different species in the same batch and removed additional chemical-component checks. Tainted, prion-infected and rotten inputs, plus recipe-specific conditions, are still rejected. Mixed batches retain actual input nutrition without claiming a single species.
Recipe lookup now states before the ingredients that tainted, prion-infected or rotten inputs cannot be processed. Updated the machine recipe page, guide and machine tooltips to match.

1.0.2 - 2026-11-05

[b]简体中文[/b]
修复自动加工时小块生肉×2被大肉干配方抢先消耗的问题：相同投料规模时优先匹配明确物品配方，小块生肉默认制作动物脂肪；指定大肉干时仍可使用小块生肉。
食品加工器与液体灌装器改为完整3×3矩形鼠标命中，透明处也能选中、拖动。
新增三条原生食材配方：小块生肉×2→动物脂肪×1；营养果×2＋食用帽菇×1→速食拉面×2；碳酸代乳×1＋普通酵母×1→合成奶酪×2。原有奶酪路线保留，营养与价值按实际投入分配，脂肪保留物种来源。
旧schema 7配置在读取时补齐新增配方，保留原有数量及加价设置，不覆盖文件。
星港气泡酒新增已发酵完成且可饮用的正品自酿酒作为酒基，保留实际酒精强度。空瓶、发酵中酒、失败酒和假酒不可投入。

[b]English[/b]
Fixed automatic processing choosing Large Jerky before Animal Fat for two small raw meat cuts. Explicit item recipes now take priority over tagged categories with the same workload. Selecting Large Jerky still allows small raw meat.
Food Processor and Liquid Bottler now receive pointer hits across their full 3x3 rectangular footprints, including transparent sprite areas.
Added three native ingredient recipes: two small raw meat cuts yield one animal fat; two Nutrifruits and one edible mushroom yield two instant ramen portions; one Pilk and one regular yeast yield two cheese portions. The existing cheese route remains. Calories and value follow actual inputs, and animal fat retains meat provenance.
Existing schema-7 configurations gain the new defaults on read while retaining customized quantities and markups; files are not overwritten.
Starport Fizz now accepts finished, drinkable, genuine homebrew wine as an alcohol base and retains its actual alcohol strength. Empty bottles, fermenting wine, failed wine and counterfeit wine are not accepted.

1.0.1 - 2026-11-05

[b]简体中文[/b]
修复鱼子酱鳗鱼拼盘无法使用鲟鱼取卵获得的鱼子酱和自行切出的鳗鱼片制作的问题。鱼子酱仍按原规则检查原料状态。

[b]English[/b]
Fixed Caviar Eel Platter rejecting caviar harvested from sturgeon when used with hand-cut eel fillets. Caviar still follows the existing ingredient checks.

1.0.0 - 2026-10-31

[b]简体中文[/b]
[list]
[*]名称恢复为“食品加工 / Food Processing”，保持独立 Mod；物品来源标记同步恢复。
[*]食品加工器与液体灌装器的模组舱改为原版未扩容布局，制造、商店供货和掉落均从初始容量开始，使用“模组舱扩充”分两次升级，读档沿用原版扩容等级。
[*]配方查询仅在食品配方最前面统一提示一次“原料需可食、无污染、成分受支持”，各项原料保留名称、数量与专用条件；实际原料检查不变。
[*]提供食品加工器与液体灌装器，两台设备共22条配方、16种自定义食品饮料，使用34个原生食品ID／合格食用变体。
[*]料理包括肉酱面、肉干、口粮、鱼松、罐头、菌菇焗碗、香辣肉粒、蔬纤饼、果味鱼肉冷餐与高档海鲜拼盘；甜品饮品包括果汁、咖啡、营养液、繁星圣代、补给冻与气泡酒。
[*]可制造原生奶酪与工业鱼饲料：奶酪保留实际营养，可用于料理和捕鼠笼；鱼饲料沿用原生热量计价、拆合与投喂效率。
[*]保留两种牲畜血清、外用酒精与蓝血袋配方，沿用原生用途、剩余次数及计价。
[*]食品营养按实际投入计算，多份产出准确分配热量与整批价值；肉料保留物种来源，气泡酒保留酒基强度。
[*]机器支持自动或指定配方，手册与G查询显示原料条件及实际批次；自动化物流按所选配方补料，生产失败保留资源。
[*]拼盘、冷餐与饮料支持原生冰镇；圣代、补给冻、蔬纤饼支持原生冷冻，沿用冰箱耗电与价值特征。
[*]拒绝污染、染朊、腐败及未支持化学成分原料；配置支持配方数量、产量、条件与加工加价，正常保存实物营养及机器选择。
[*]接入原生战利品、杰克逊夜间商店、额外顾客供货及新周目手册，提供六套本地化与配套像素图标，需要NicoKobo Forge。
[/list]

[b]English[/b]
[list]
[*]Restored Food Processing as the independent mod name, with matching item source labels.
[*]Prepared the first full-release version with two machines, 22 recipes and 16 custom foods and drinks using native edible inputs, plus cheese, industrial fish feed and livestock medical supplies.
[*]Nutrition and batch value come from actual inputs and are distributed across outputs, preserving species, alcohol strength, native uses and remaining charges.
[*]Supports automatic or selected recipes, manuals and G lookup, plus selected-recipe logistics refills. Processing pauses for missing materials or power, invalid inputs or insufficient room for the complete output.
[*]Rejects contaminated, infected, rotten and unsupported ingredients, with configurable quantities, yields, conditions and processing markup.
[*]Compatible meals, desserts and drinks use native chilling or freezing; machines, nutrition, batches and selected recipes follow normal saves.
[*]Both machines start with native unexpanded module bays and use the two native expansions. Recipe lookup states shared ingredient requirements once while preserving recipe-specific conditions.
[*]Integrated loot, night shops, customer supplies and the opening manual, with icons and six localizations; requires NicoKobo Forge.
[/list]
